How each item you listed is handled (federal)
- W-2 from Riverside Hospital ($84,900)
  - Report on Form 1040 using the W-2. No special action other than including it in total income.
- Self-employment income (graphic design) $8,900
  - Report on Schedule C (profit/loss from business). Deduct ordinary and necessary business expenses here (see home office and any of the $890 if it’s related to the business).
  - Net profit flows to Form 1040 (Schedule 1) and is subject to self-employment tax (Schedule SE). You can deduct half of SE tax as an adjustment on Schedule 1.
