Forms you’ll likely need (federal)
- Form 1040 — individual return
- Schedule 1 (Form 1040) — for adjustments (student loan interest, half SE tax if applicable)
- Schedule C (Profit or Loss from Business) — report freelance/graphic income and business expenses (including home office if you don’t use the simplified method) 
