   - 1099‑NEC / records for the $8,900 (invoices, receipts)
   - 1099‑INT statements for the $1,240 interest
   - 1098‑E or loan statements showing student loan interest paid
   - Charitable receipt for $1,400
   - Records/receipts for the $890 expenses and note whether they are business-related
