9) Recordkeeping and practical notes
- Keep receipts, bank statements, 1098‑E from MOHELA (student loan interest), rent receipts / lease and utility bills for home‑office substantiation, and written acknowledgement for charitable contributions > $250.
- If you expect to owe tax due to self‑employment income and not enough withholding, consider making estimated quarterly payments or increasing withholding to avoid underpayment penalties.

